      "note": "The same ~/qwen-serving/venv serves both profiles, so the same patch set applies. Nothing records that they are applied — RE-APPLY AFTER ANY pip install, upgrade or venv rebuild.\n\nvllm-pr48375-mamba-prefix-eagle.patch gates PREFIX_CACHE=1 here exactly as it does for W8A16: the hybrid GDN backbone and the MTP head are properties of the checkpoint, not of the quantisation. Documented in deploy/profiles/ENGINE-PATCHES.md.",
